= The Array of Forces

Our enemies are the the radical, revolutionary RFB, with [+ rfb_strength +] thousand troops. The loyalties of the Reichsbanner, with its [+ rb_strength +] members, the Reichswehr, with its [+ reichswehr_strength +] thousand regular soldiers, and Prussian police, with [+ prussian_police_strength +] thousand members, are unclear.

On our side, we have the loyal parts of the Reichsbanner, with [+ rb_strength +] members, and the reactionary SA with [+ sa_strength +] thousand and Stahlhelm with [+ sh_strength +] thousand members.
  
